			<item>
				<title>Tham Nong Tao</title>
				<link>/posts/tham-nong-tao/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>/posts/tham-nong-tao/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;details&#34;&gt;Details&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;identification&#34;&gt;Identification&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feature type:&lt;/strong&gt; Cave&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;cave-and-exploration-data&#34;&gt;Cave and exploration data&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exploration potential:&lt;/strong&gt; VeryHigh&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Goes to water:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;diving-data&#34;&gt;Diving data&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Water type:&lt;/strong&gt; Fresh&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tidal:&lt;/strong&gt; No&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;additional-notes&#34;&gt;Additional Notes&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Thai Cave Exploration, Day 1&#xA;Our initial plan was to go dry caving and extend the existing survey done by Didier Rateau and his team.&#xA;Once at the first site (Tham Nong Tao) we were surprised to find out that the whole cave system was underwater. This obviously was a good thing for us cave divers but I remember swearing as I was prepared for documenting dry…&#xA;The water level was too deep to walk so we used a tiny “one-man-research-kayak” we found stranded at the entrance to carry our land gear to avoid swimming with it.&#xA;At 250 metres in we reached the end of the surveyed area and Naomi Allen had the privilege to be the first diver ever in this system and to discover that the cave still goes further!&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Near by the cave there is a man made damm that restricts the water flow out. According to a local cave expert Manatthawut ChuSaeng, this unique feature enables this system to be completely submerged during rainy season and almost dry the rest of the year. Cat fish live inside so there will be water through out the year, just need to find where it goes the next time.&#xA;Our second target (Tham Lum Pho) under the same mountain had surprisingly no water at all?&#xA;Ofcourse we now had a bit if dive gear and left the land camera equipment in the car… Luckily we didn’t carry our ccr’s with us.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
